  - characterId: C004_AnSi
    characterName: "\u1EA8n S\u0129 S\u01A1n L\xE2m"
    element: 5
    elementHexColor: '#8A6A3E'
    description: "K\u1EF3 nh\xE2n t\u1EF1 tu n\u1ED9i l\u1EF1c ch\u1ED1n th\xE2m
      s\u01A1n, h\xF2a h\u1EE3p l\xE0m m\u1ED9t v\u1EDBi n\xFAi r\u1EEBng b\u1EA3n
      \u0111\u1ECBa. D\u1ED3n l\u1EF1c b\u1ED9c ph\xE1t \u0111\u1ECBa kh\xED."
    signatureSkillName: "Th\u1EADp Ph\u01B0\u01A1ng Ch\u1EA5n Th\u1EBF"
    signatureSkillDesc: "Tr\u1EEB 30% HP hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i b\u1ED9c ph\xE1t \u0111\u1ECBa
      kh\xED ch\u1EA5n n\u1EE9t \u0111\u1EA5t \u0111\xE1, g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      + Cho\xE1ng 1.2s v\xE0 \u0111\u1EA9y l\xF9i 8m/s."
    passiveTraitName: "B\xE0n Th\u1EA1ch Chi Khu"
    passiveTraitDesc: "M\xE1u c\xE0ng th\u1EA5p th\u1EE7 c\xE0ng cao. Khi HP d\u01B0\u1EDBi
      50%, nh\u1EADn th\xEAm 30% Kh\xE1ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0 mi\u1EC5n
      nhi\u1EC5m \u0110\u1EA9y l\xF9i."
    avatar: {fileID: 3200000000, guid: 3200000000000000a0b77823fca88d01, type: 3}
